                                                "sense_id": "f053eb58-74f5-31fa-85fe-1e46b3d645e1",
                                                "text": "In may 1831, I proceeded from Bombay to Panoovellee in a small Patamar, I sailed in the afternoon and arrived there before day break, I paid for the whole Patamar five Rupees, but a boat usually sails every day from Bombay to Panoovellee at the cost of a quarter of a Rupee for each person, […]"
